From 7ef809610007cf6c001abde37d20ee8693bda9b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:58:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] test-posix: Check msgget, msgctl, msgsnd and msgrcv

Creation and lookup by key, every msqid_ds member through IPC_STAT
and IPC_SET, type selection, blocking sends and receives woken by
room, a message, a signal or removal, and the permission errors.
The tests detect QEMU's misplaced 32-bit ARM msqid_ds at run time,
so test-msgrcv now runs against glibc on arm too.
---
